 url={https://www.numdam.org/item/PMIHES_1966__31__59_0.pdf},
 note={Primary full text opened and read 2026-11-19. Theorem 1 and Corollary 2, printed p59, with the full proof pp60--64, give integral points from points modulo every power of the uniformizer for a henselian DVR whose completion is separable in positive characteristic. No finite residue-field assumption is imposed. The ordinary decision algorithms from uniform congruence decisions are derived explicitly in the manuscript.}
